# Lane-created pre-edit backups (e.g. tools/oc-x.pre-20260925-115731). Generated
# residue: they accumulate, nothing reaps them, and because oc-ledger's
# stray-guard reads a full `git status --porcelain`, a single UNTRACKED one
# blocks every version bump with die 7. Same class as *.bak above.
*.pre-*

# The battery red-receipt transcript (#517/#614). Since #614 the receipt embeds
# its own evidence (fail_rows), so this file is a transient human-readable
# transcript, not a durable artifact -- and being untracked it tripped the
# sync stray-guard (die 7) while a red was under investigation.
tools/tests/battery-last-fail.log
